OL,3,ARosie O'Donnell and Julie Hesmondhalgh
OL,4,Ato appear in play about Gisele Pelicot
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe play has been created from
OL,8,Fdocuments from the trial and
OL,9,Fpsychiatric reports of dozens of men
OL,10,Fwho were prosecuted in the case, which
OL,11,Fcaused outrage in France and around the
OL,12,Fworld, and turned Gisele Pelicot into a
OL,13,Fsymbol of strength against sexual
OL,14,Fassault.
OL,16,FDominique Pelicot was jailed for 20
OL,17,Fyears for drugging and raping his then
OL,18,Fwife, and allowing 50 other men to rape
OL,19,Fher while she was unconscious.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
